裸足で歩く姿を見てみたいものです。\nありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12VaQhfns3KiWglXqQ20s1u62ZZkcJj3s?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@namu_t22/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/de144f6a/uploads/origins/13d7dc3a-dc9c-4d30-8c2d-e452b64c328c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5c637ab2527dac4b1fa764f66c9fff04", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/de144f6a/uploads/origins/13d7dc3a-dc9c-4d30-8c2d-e452b64c328c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5c637ab2527dac4b1fa764f66c9fff04, https://si.imgix.net/de144f6a/uploads/origins/13d7dc3a-dc9c-4d30-8c2d-e452b64c328c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26e1fb6f8dc6eca7e09ef9c2e56cc91e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/de144f6a/uploads/origins/13d7dc3a-dc9c-4d30-8c2d-e452b64c328c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4690fe011cd93c3e2d7f57f5c6bef0f4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。あなたのアートスタイルが大好きです!私はVtuberのキャラクターのアートをリクエストしたいです。彼女は血と雨が好きです。とても暗くて憂鬱な雰囲気で描いていただきたいです。眉毛も描いてください。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/CDwY0rL\nhttps://imgur.com/a/CDwY0rL", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@namu_t22/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1396679e/requests/253241_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4e8f966f25ac4722bf6c7ee2fe7f3e02", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1396679e/requests/253241_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4e8f966f25ac4722bf6c7ee2fe7f3e02, https://si.imgix.net/1396679e/requests/253241_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54230a4ff2ed25a07aea2331131778fb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1396679e/requests/253241_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f54da6f3978a19cd59b092098a16865 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you! I saw your work on Twitter and was attracted by the atmosphere of your work, so I made a request.\nI would like to request a character of my creation.\nShe is a wizard girl who spends her time with her grandfather who is a hat. You can find all the details at the link.\n\nI don't care how you cook up the situation, the atmosphere, or the character herself in the picture, so I'd be happy if you could draw whatever comes to your mind as you like: ......!\n(If you deliver it as a psd file, it would be great if you could separate the layers for the address, etc.)\n\n(If you deliver it as a psd file, please separate the layers of the address.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1BgP0L6q8c3ZccJfC45QKdBe7YOa8XVup?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@namu_t22/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6b3c9c53/requests/206138_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d8d55cee22eb63b5577e0262ea135ad6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6b3c9c53/requests/206138_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d8d55cee22eb63b5577e0262ea135ad6, https://si.imgix.net/6b3c9c53/requests/206138_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67161b9cf6a4e375a7177c8b1553f1d6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6b3c9c53/requests/206138_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0cbe3f4226686118911866caa233350e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Her hair is pink. It's shaggy and long. Dead eyes with dark circles and gray pupils. Her pupils are spirals. Her hands are bandaged from her arms to the backs of her hands. She wears a rosary on her chest. The whole atmosphere is dark and sickly. He wears a black collar. Please draw a nun with large breasts. I would be happy if you could provide me with a line drawing or rough sketch in PSD. Thank you for your cooperation.", "created_at": "", "comp